  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_ac62aa48-70c4-4f1d-8c32-a1fa00b93433.png\" alt=\"Tough As Nails 标志\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fglitchfiend.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_c0ac8421-76cc-495e-a72e-acee3ea9954c.png\" alt=\"在 Bluesky 上关注\" width=\"220\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fGlitchfiend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_452403c6-3e00-4724-9374-3bc2cc63c95c.png\" alt=\"在 X 上关注\" width=\"168\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/GyyzU6T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_ad556c43-5917-431a-8235-9b35362bb4e9.png\" alt=\"加入我们的 Discord\" width=\"212\" height=\"38\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Adubbz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_6f92a5cd-9aaa-413d-977a-17f1d8514f5f.png\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持\" width=\"236\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dAdubbzG%2540gmail.com%2526cy_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_fa447003-984d-4019-abd1-9672a3bc22a6.png\" alt=\"通过 PayPal 捐赠\" width=\"218\" height=\"38\"></a></p>\n<h2>简介</h2>\n<hr>\n<h4>Tough As Nails 是一款生存模组，添加了多种功能以增加游戏难度，包括体温和口渴系统。</h4>\n<h3>注意：体温机制在 1.16 版本中不可用！</h3>\n<h2>信息与条款</h2>\n<hr>\n<h3>Minecraft 1.20.4 及以上版本*需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_495a5f28-8271-4409-8b44-eb0f4ff99ea7.png\" alt=\"GlitchCore 图标\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GlitchCore</a>！Fabric 版本还需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>。</h3>\n<p><em>*mod 版本 9.2.0.171 及以上的 1.20.1 版本也需要</em></p>\n<p><em>您可以将此模组包含在由 CurseForge 托管的整合包中，前提是不得重新托管该模组，仅使用我们直接上传的版本，不出售整合包或通过任何方式出售对该模组的额外访问权限，并遵守所用模组版本许可证中列出的所有条款。</em></p>\n<h2>更多 Glitchfiend 的作品</h2>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_536c8bbe-66d9-4d24-86f7-e65b8e346053.png\" alt=\"Biomes O' Plenty 标志\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serene-seasons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_afd5e266-e85c-4127-99cf-84092e4adbd5.png\" alt=\"Serene Seasons 标志\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></a></p>",
